# label: alg:ch88-check
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch88.tex:53
# caption: Validate a rewrite over a stated finite semantic domain.

REQUIRE rule, finite variable domains, independent semantics including failures/effects
ENSURE counterexample or exhaustive agreement for that domain only
FORALL assignments to rule variables DO
  evaluate both sides under the same input state and applicable premises
  compare values, final observable state, errors, and termination classification
  IF outcomes differ THEN
    return the assignment as counterexample
  END IF
END FOR
record domain and evaluator version with the verified rule

